### Response Format:

**If the method CANNOT return null at this specific call site:**
```xml
<response>
  <reason><![CDATA[EXPLAIN WHY THE INVOCATION ((ColorAttribute) (combinedAttributes.get(ColorAttribute.Diffuse))) RESULT CANNOT BE NULL.]]></reason>
  <value>NO</value>
</response>
```

**If the method CAN return null at this specific call site:**
```xml
<response>
  <reason><![CDATA[EXPLAIN WHY THE INVOCATION ((ColorAttribute) (combinedAttributes.get(ColorAttribute.Diffuse))) RESULT CAN BE NULL.]]></reason>
  <value>YES</value>
</response>
```

